====================================================================================================
   M 1e+17 g: k 2.36e+14/Mpc, T_form 1.38e+07 GeV, t 1.2e-21 s, beta 4.22e-17; dc 0.45 -> P_zeta 0.015 (7.2e+06 x A_s), d ln f/d ln P 34.2, 1% amount needs P_zeta to 0.03%
   M 1e+18 g: k 7.46e+13/Mpc, T_form 4.35e+06 GeV, t 1.2e-20 s, beta 1.33e-16; dc 0.45 -> P_zeta 0.016 (7.5e+06 x A_s), d ln f/d ln P 33.1, 1% amount needs P_zeta to 0.03%
   M 1e+19 g: k 2.36e+13/Mpc, T_form 1.38e+06 GeV, t 1.2e-19 s, beta 4.22e-16; dc 0.45 -> P_zeta 0.016 (7.8e+06 x A_s), d ln f/d ln P 32.0, 1% amount needs P_zeta to 0.03%
   M 1e+20 g: k 7.46e+12/Mpc, T_form 4.35e+05 GeV, t 1.2e-18 s, beta 1.33e-15; dc 0.45 -> P_zeta 0.017 (8.0e+06 x A_s), d ln f/d ln P 30.8, 1% amount needs P_zeta to 0.03%
   M 1e+21 g: k 2.36e+12/Mpc, T_form 1.38e+05 GeV, t 1.2e-17 s, beta 4.22e-15; dc 0.45 -> P_zeta 0.018 (8.4e+06 x A_s), d ln f/d ln P 29.7, 1% amount needs P_zeta to 0.03%
   M 1e+22 g: k 7.46e+11/Mpc, T_form 4.35e+04 GeV, t 1.2e-16 s, beta 1.33e-14; dc 0.45 -> P_zeta 0.018 (8.7e+06 x A_s), d ln f/d ln P 28.6, 1% amount needs P_zeta to 0.04%
   spike scale k >= 7.5e+11/Mpc (CMB/LSS k <~ 1, mu-distortion 1-1e4/Mpc: recalled) and isocurvature negligible -> COMPATIBLE with the CMB adiabatic, near scale-invariant spectrum (needs a feature ~7 orders up at k >~ 1e12/Mpc)
   formation T >= 4.3e+04 GeV >> electroweak 1e2 GeV: the PBH amount is set before (and independently of) baryogenesis;
   Omega_c/Omega_b = 5.364 would then be a coincidence of the spike amplitude and eta_b. AMOUNT: RESTATEMENT (moved into P_zeta,
   which must be tuned to ~0.03% and placed by hand in k). With critical-collapse/non-Gaussian corrections the numbers move, the verdict does not.

