   -> 1e21-1e22 g PBHs perturb inner-planet ranging at the cm-m level per decade (a recalled proposal; ephemeris data needs a go).
   microlensing: the wave-optics edge (3.3e+22 g) predicts chromatic, sub-geometric magnification for M31/HSC-type events at
