OVERALL: VIABLE-CONDITIONAL; AMOUNT: RESTATEMENT
  window (robust) 1.0e+17-1.0e+22 g, (maximal) 4.1e+17-3.0e+21 g; conditions: (1) the settling postulate (no mechanism; PBHs close FL1 and the phonon arm);
  (2) the recalled band edges (curves need the owner's go); (3) a spike P_zeta ~ 0.015-0.02 (tuned to ~0.03%) at k ~ 1e12-1e14/Mpc;
  (4) A2: isotropic equilibrium exists (no anisotropy condition).
  kappa = 1/2 FITTED; the cold energy's mass is still required (PBHs supply it without a new particle); not theory closed.
